&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It currently contains the following projects:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;reactable html-widget html-fill-item&#34; id=&#34;htmlwidget-1&#34; style=&#34;width:auto;height:auto;&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
